<%- include('partials/header') %>
<main class="about-page">
  <section class="section about-story-hero">
    <div class="about-story-copy">
      <div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span>›</span>About OSIRA</div>
      <span class="kicker">OMAANSH INDUSTRIES · EST. 2021 · JAIPUR</span>
      <h1>Thoughtful wall clocks for everyday spaces and business needs.</h1>
      <p class="about-lead">OSIRA is the wall-clock brand of Omaansh Industries, based in Jaipur, Rajasthan. We bring together practical product choices, decorative styles and enquiry-led support for retail, wholesale, corporate gifting and custom-branded requirements.</p>
      <div class="actions"><a class="btn primary" href="/products">Explore wall clocks</a><button class="btn secondary" type="button" data-open-enquiry>Discuss a business order</button></div>
      <div class="about-proof-pills"><span><b>01</b> Product-led guidance</span><span><b>02</b> Bulk enquiries</span><span><b>03</b> Custom order discussions</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="about-story-visual">
      <picture>
        <% if(site?.aboutMobileHeroImage){ %><source media="(max-width:700px)" srcset="<%= site.aboutMobileHeroImage %>"><% } %>
        <img src="<%= site?.aboutDesktopHeroImage || site?.aboutFactoryImage || 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497366754035-f200968a6e72?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=85' %>" alt="OSIRA business and workplace supply" width="1200" height="900" fetchpriority="high">
      </picture>
      <div class="about-image-note"><span class="about-note-icon" aria-hidden="true">◷</span><div><strong>Designed around real requirements</strong><span>Product, quantity, branding and delivery—discussed clearly before an order is confirmed.</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section about-facts-strip" aria-label="About OSIRA at a glance">
    <div><span class="about-fact-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌂</span><strong>Jaipur, Rajasthan</strong><span>Business base</span></div>
    <div><span class="about-fact-icon" aria-hidden="true">◷</span><strong>Since 2021</strong><span>OSIRA / Omaansh Industries</span></div>
    <div><span class="about-fact-icon" aria-hidden="true">▦</span><strong>Approx. 4,000 sq. ft.</strong><span>Facility footprint</span></div>
    <div><span class="about-fact-icon" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><strong>Up to 1 lakh / month</strong><span>Stated production capacity</span></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section about-purpose-section">
    <div class="about-section-heading"><span class="kicker">OUR PURPOSE</span><h2>Useful design. Clear communication. Lasting value.</h2><p>Our aim is to make wall clocks and décor easier to choose for the spaces and people they serve—while improving design, product understanding and the buying experience over time.</p></div>
    <div class="about-purpose-grid">
      <article><span class="about-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">◎</span><h3>Our mission</h3><p>To offer thoughtfully designed wall clocks and décor that balance everyday function, considered aesthetics and practical value for homes, workplaces and commercial spaces.</p></article>
      <article><span class="about-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</span><h3>Our vision</h3><p>To build a trusted Indian brand recognised for creative product thinking, dependable communication and a customer-first approach to wall-clock supply.</p></article>
      <article><span class="about-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">◇</span><h3>Our promise</h3><p>To help buyers clarify product style, size, branding and quantity before confirming current availability, pricing and delivery terms.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section about-capability-section">
    <div class="about-capability-image">
      <% if(site?.aboutFactoryImage){ %><img src="<%= site.aboutFactoryImage %>" alt="Omaansh Industries manufacturing facility in Jaipur" width="1000" height="800" loading="lazy"><% }else{ %><div class="about-photo-placeholder"><span aria-hidden="true">⌂</span><strong>Manufacturing & workplace</strong><small>Upload a real facility photo in Admin → Site Settings.</small></div><% } %>
      <span class="about-photo-caption">Manufacturing / workplace image</span>
    </div>
    <div class="about-capability-copy"><span class="kicker">FROM JAIPUR TO BUSINESS BUYERS</span><h2>Product options with a practical route to quotation.</h2><p>Different buyers need different things. A retailer may be comparing designs and replenishment needs; an office may be sourcing functional clocks; a business may need branded clocks for a campaign, event or gift programme.</p><p>OSIRA helps bring those details into one conversation, so the next step is based on the actual order rather than assumptions.</p>
      <ul class="about-check-list"><li><span>✓</span> Browse product styles and collections</li><li><span>✓</span> Discuss quantity and intended application</li><li><span>✓</span> Share artwork or branding requirements</li><li><span>✓</span> Confirm specifications and commercial terms before ordering</li></ul>
      <a class="text-link" href="/services">Explore business services →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section about-photo-gallery-section">
    <div class="about-section-heading"><span class="kicker">BEHIND THE PRODUCT</span><h2>Show the people, process and care behind the brand.</h2><p>Replace these image slots with current company photography from the admin settings. Real photos help buyers understand the business and its working environment.</p></div>
    <div class="about-photo-gallery">
      <figure><% if(site?.aboutFactoryImage){ %><img src="<%= site.aboutFactoryImage %>" alt="Omaansh Industries manufacturing facility" width="800" height="600" loading="lazy"><% }else{ %><div class="about-photo-placeholder"><span aria-hidden="true">⌂</span><strong>Manufacturing & workplace</strong><small>Upload a real facility photo</small></div><% } %><figcaption><strong>Manufacturing & workplace</strong><span>Show the facility and work environment</span></figcaption></figure>
      <figure><% if(site?.aboutQualityImage){ %><img src="<%= site.aboutQualityImage %>" alt="Omaansh Industries quality and packing work" width="800" height="600" loading="lazy"><% }else{ %><div class="about-photo-placeholder"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span><strong>Quality & packing</strong><small>Upload a real inspection or packing photo</small></div><% } %><figcaption><strong>Quality & packing</strong><span>Show actual inspection or dispatch preparation</span></figcaption></figure>
      <figure><% if(site?.aboutTeamImage){ %><img src="<%= site.aboutTeamImage %>" alt="Omaansh Industries team" width="800" height="600" loading="lazy"><% }else{ %><div class="about-photo-placeholder"><span aria-hidden="true">♧</span><strong>People & partnership</strong><small>Upload a real team photo</small></div><% } %><figcaption><strong>People & partnership</strong><span>Introduce the real team behind OSIRA</span></figcaption></figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section about-offerings-section">
    <div class="about-section-heading"><span class="kicker">HOW WE CAN HELP</span><h2>One brand, several ways to source.</h2><p>Choose the route that best fits your requirement. Product availability, minimum quantities and lead times are confirmed for the specific order.</p></div>
    <div class="about-offerings-grid">
      <a href="/categories"><span aria-hidden="true">▦</span><div><h3>Wall clock collections</h3><p>Explore designs by collection and product type.</p><b>Browse collections ↗</b></div></a>
      <a href="/services/wholesale-wall-clocks"><span aria-hidden="true">▤</span><div><h3>Wholesale supply</h3><p>Discuss assortment, quantity and repeat requirements.</p><b>Explore wholesale ↗</b></div></a>
      <a href="/services/corporate-gifting"><span aria-hidden="true">◇</span><div><h3>Corporate gifting</h3><p>Plan wall-clock gifts for teams, events and organisations.</p><b>Explore gifting ↗</b></div></a>
      <a href="/services/custom-oem-wall-clocks"><span aria-hidden="true">✳</span><div><h3>Custom branding & OEM</h3><p>Discuss logo artwork, custom presentation and private-label needs.</p><b>Explore custom options ↗</b></div></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section about-team-section">
    <div class="about-team-copy"><span class="kicker">PEOPLE & PARTNERSHIP</span><h2>Good orders start with the right questions.</h2><p>We believe a useful buying conversation begins with the details: where the clock will be used, which style is needed, how many pieces are required, whether branding is involved and where the order must be delivered.</p><p>Share those details with our team and we can guide the discussion toward relevant options and the information needed for a clear quotation.</p><button class="btn primary" type="button" data-open-enquiry>Talk to our team →</button></div>
    <div class="about-team-photo"><% if(site?.aboutTeamImage){ %><img src="<%= site.aboutTeamImage %>" alt="Omaansh Industries team in Jaipur" width="900" height="700" loading="lazy"><% }else{ %><div class="about-photo-placeholder"><span aria-hidden="true">♧</span><strong>People & partnership</strong><small>Upload a real owner or team photo in Admin → Site Settings.</small></div><% } %><span class="about-photo-caption">Team / owner photo can be managed in admin</span></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section about-values-band">
    <div><span class="kicker">WHAT GUIDES US</span><h2>Principles behind the product and the experience.</h2></div>
    <div class="about-values-list"><article><span>01</span><div><h3>Quality-minded</h3><p>Pay attention to product details and confirm the relevant specifications.</p></div></article><article><span>02</span><div><h3>Customer-focused</h3><p>Start with the buyer’s use case, quantity and constraints.</p></div></article><article><span>03</span><div><h3>Practical innovation</h3><p>Keep exploring useful styles, customisation and product presentation.</p></div></article><article><span>04</span><div><h3>Honest communication</h3><p>Confirm availability, pricing, delivery and order terms before commitment.</p></div></article></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section about-contact-card">
    <div><span class="kicker">VISIT / CONTACT</span><h2>Let’s discuss your wall-clock requirement.</h2><p><%= site?.streetAddress || '24, Shree Shyam Vatika, Gokulpura, Kalwar Road, Jaipur, Rajasthan 302012' %></p><div class="about-contact-links"><a href="tel:<%= site?.primaryPhone || '+91141616961' %>">Call <%= site?.primaryPhone || '+91 141 616961' %></a><a href="mailto:<%= site?.email || 'hello@omaansh.com' %>"><%= site?.email || 'hello@omaansh.com' %></a></div></div>
    <div class="about-contact-actions"><a class="btn primary" href="/#enquiry">Request a quotation</a><a class="btn secondary" href="https://wa.me/<%= (site?.whatsappNumber || '919509912556').replace(/[^0-9]/g,'') %>?text=<%= encodeURIComponent('Hello OSIRA, I would like to discuss a wall clock requirement.') %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WhatsApp OSIRA ↗</a></div>
  </section>
</main>
<%- include('partials/footer', { site }) %>
